{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"bows to Viola \"We each have a purpose, each our own fate.  I am happy to carry all of you with me until the day I die.  I will pass you on to others, and they others.  Some may someday fade, but the memory of you collectively will become a legend, and someday even myth within the cosmos, the tale altering with each retelling, but never fully dyeing.  Even if your soul is consumed, and the tiny spark of divinity it represents is gone forever, these people and this town will live on through me.  I think that is a good enough life for any man.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T17:17:36.639000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746055350675046440","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
