{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Ozen","id":"321508500138360843","is_bot":0,"username":"ozenannwn"},"author_id":"321508500138360843","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"||\"I wasn't sure if it was ok to fight cause everyone just seemed scared or angry that were fighting. But I don't want my friend to hurt anymore.... ..so, I guess I don't have to answer that other question. Not til I am aware of more possible answers anyway...\"||","created_at":"2020-08-20T17:37:55.110000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746060461312573501","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
