{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"\"Well, my story is simple out of one try at being the hero I hear of.  My parents were wonderful and loving, I had a great childhood.  I have suffered no real trauma, and have a happy life.  Other than my vanity, I would say I live the best life I can, and do good deeds by heling people find the hero within.  I care that we all survive, and that you cant stop the signal that is history from passing from person to person.  I seek to immortalize all those that deserve it.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T17:38:50.093000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746060691928252456","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
